    "启动后： \n 1. 充电时，当电池电量达到%lld%%发出提醒 \n 2. 耗电时，当电池电量低到%lld%%发出提醒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After launch:\n1. During charging, a reminder will be issued when the battery level reaches %1$lld%%.\n2. During discharging, a reminder will be issued when the battery level drops to %2$lld%%."
          }
        }
